$ Revision History
$ Revision	Date		Change
$	1.2	26Jul2002	Neal's release to RSI for Series C
$	2.1	14Aug2002	Begin changes to make CIP version
$				Added 1_RSNetWorx_DNetTool and 1_RSNetWorx_NoAutoEnter to [Device]
$				Added [Device Classification]
$				Changed all Param data types to the new numbers
$				Chaned to inline Enums and deleted [ENUM PAR]
$				Added ProxiedAssems 2-4 (and modified)
$				Added ProxiedParam 1-3 (and modified)
$				Added [Connection Manager] section (picked correct connection #'s)
$				Added [Port] and [Modular] Section (Hid ExtrnID - only for Rack)
$	2.2	15Aug2002	Added ExcludeFromAdapterRackConnection keyword (PDT)
$				Changed ProxyConnects to Connects and filled in
$				Added Assem125,126,127
$				Added Param101,102,103,104
$	2.3	30Sep2002	Returned [Groups] section (RSNetworx is fixed)
$	2.4	29Jan2003	Fix up for RSNetworx4.11 - 'Display Only' Logix connections
$	2.5	30Jan2003	Removed Header in Assem126/127 and Param103/104
$	3.1	23Dec2003	PLC/SLC support for CNet and ENet.  Changes to
$				Assem125,126,127, Connections
$	3.2	11Jan2003	Updated Device Revision to 3.3
$	4.1	30Nov2004	Added Assem124 - Changed CNXNs for 3rd Party
$	5.1	25Jan2006	Update to new DeviceNet Premier Integration EDS Guidelines
$				Removed Assem124 from Listen Only Connection
$	5.2	03Nov2009	Deleted Assem104
$	5.3	15Jul2011	Changed Product code to 200
$	5.4	10Sep2012	Changed Assembly 123 string name


$ NOTE: may be able to play with ENUMs so (invalid) does not show up

